00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.320
But this solved the
out-of-memory error

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.190
and the scale issue.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:16.510
So this is the model input
data and architecture.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:19.570
First you need a parsing
