progress for a long time.

00:34:39.650 --> 00:34:41.150
While you figure
things out, you can

00:34:41.150 --> 00:34:44.179
work towards those solutions.

00:34:44.179 --> 00:34:47.690
Using TensorFlow stuff, we've
seen better predictions,

00:34:47.690 --> 00:34:54.139
